{
  "id": "create-recording-rule-lj-preview",
  "title": "Create a recording rule (preview)",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create a Grafana-managed recording rule on your Grafana Cloud stack to see how the parts of the form produce a recorded metric. You query the recorded metric in Explore to see the data the rule wrote, then delete the rule."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Open the **New recording rule** form and give the rule its two names."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-rule-name-the-rule",
      "title": "Name the rule and the metric",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/alerting/list",
          "content": "Go to **Alert rules**.",
          "verify": "on-page:/alerting/list"
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Click **More**, then select **New Grafana recording rule**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/list"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid rule-list more-menu-trigger-button']",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/list",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[role='menuitem'][href='/alerting/new/grafana-recording']",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule name-field']",
          "targetvalue": "Total active series",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In **Name**, enter a name for the rule itself. This path uses `Total active series`."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "input#metric",
          "targetvalue": "test_active_series_total",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In **Metric**, enter the name for the recorded metric. This path uses `test_active_series_total`."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "A dashboard or an alert rule uses this name to get the recorded metric. The name can't contain spaces."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='target-data-source']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Notice **Target data source**. It shows the Prometheus data source that belongs to your own stack. Leave it as it is."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The target data source is where the rule writes the recorded metric. The recorded metric is stored on your stack, with your stack's other metrics.\n\nThe data source the rule queries is a different field. You select it in the next milestone."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "A recording rule has a rule name for the rule itself and a metric name for the recorded metric."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Select the data source the rule queries and enter the query."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-rule-add-the-query",
      "title": "Add the query",
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafanacloud-usage"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Query editor row'] input[data-testid='data-testid Select a data source']",
          "targetvalue": "grafanacloud-usage",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In query **A**, select **grafanacloud-usage** as the data source the rule queries."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid QueryEditorModeToggle']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Select **Code** if it isn't already selected."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Query editor row'] textarea.inputarea",
          "targetvalue": "sum(grafanacloud_instance_active_series)",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In the field that reads **Enter a PromQL query…**, enter `sum(grafanacloud_instance_active_series)`."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This query returns the total number of active series on your stack. When **Explain** is on, Grafana describes each part of the query under the field."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule step-2'] header:contains('Recording rule output')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Find the **Reduce** expression under **Expressions**. **Reduce** turns each series the query returns into a single number, and that number is what the rule records. The form adds it for you. Leave it as it is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The rule queries one data source and records a single number from the result."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Give the rule a folder and an evaluation group, then save it."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-rule-set-evaluation-and-save",
      "title": "Set the evaluation and save the rule",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Click **New folder**, name it `Recording rule practice (learning path)`, and click **Create**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule folder-picker'] button:contains('New folder')",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule name-folder-name-field']",
              "targetvalue": "Recording rule practice (learning path)",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule name-folder-name-create-button']",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule folder-picker']:contains('Recording rule practice (learning path)')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Focus on **Folder**. It shows **Recording rule practice (learning path)**, the folder you created. The folder is where the rule is stored."
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Click **New evaluation group**, name it `Practice group`, leave **Evaluation interval** at `1m`, and click **Create**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule new-evaluation-group-button']",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule new-evaluation-group-name']",
              "targetvalue": "Practice group",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule new-evaluation-group-create-button']",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule group-picker']:contains('Practice group')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Find **Evaluation group and interval**. It shows **Practice group**, the evaluation group you created."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "An evaluation group evaluates all its rules on the same evaluation interval. The evaluation interval is how often a recording rule is evaluated. With `1m`, this rule is evaluated every minute, and each evaluation writes one new data point to the recorded metric."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule save-rule-button']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/grafana-recording",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "on-page:/alerting/grafana/",
          "content": "Click **Save**."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "Grafana saves the rule and opens a page for **Total active series**, the rule you created."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "div:text('Metric name')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/grafana/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Notice **Metric name**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[aria-labelledby='target-datasource-uid']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/grafana/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "View **Target data source**."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This is where the rule writes the recorded metric. It shows your stack's managed Prometheus data source, because you left the field as it was."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='queries-container']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/grafana/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Focus on query **A** and its graph."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The graph shows the query, which is the data the rule reads from `grafanacloud-usage`. It isn't the recorded metric. The recorded metric has no data until the rule's first evaluation."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "span:text('Last evaluated')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/grafana/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Find **Last evaluated**."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "**Last evaluated** shows a time after the rule's first evaluation. Until then, it shows a dash."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The rule is saved and is evaluated once a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Query the recorded metric in **Explore** to see the data the rule has written."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-rule-query-the-metric",
      "title": "Query the recorded metric in Explore",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/explore",
          "content": "Go to **Explore**.",
          "verify": "on-page:/explore"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid explore-toolbar'] [data-testid='data-testid Data source picker select container']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/explore",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Select your stack's Prometheus data source, if it isn't already selected. The rule saved the recorded metric there."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid QueryEditorModeToggle']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/explore",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true,
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Select **Code** if it isn't already selected."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Query field'] textarea.inputarea",
          "targetvalue": "test_active_series_total",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/explore",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In the query field, enter `test_active_series_total`, the metric name you entered for the rule. If the field already holds a query, replace it."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid RefreshPicker run button']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/explore",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Click **Run query**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Panel header Graph']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/explore",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Find the **Graph** panel. It shows one data point for each evaluation of the rule."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "Soon after you save the rule, the graph has one point. The rule writes another each minute. If the graph shows **No data**, the rule hasn't been evaluated yet. Wait a minute, then click **Run query** again.\n\nDashboards and alert rules can query `test_active_series_total` the same way."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The recorded metric has a new data point for each evaluation, and you can query it by its metric name."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Delete the rule you created."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-rule-delete-the-rule",
      "title": "Delete the rule",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/alerting/list",
          "content": "Go to **Alert rules**.",
          "verify": "on-page:/alerting/list"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alerting search-input']",
          "targetvalue": "Total active series",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/list",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In the search box, enter `Total active series`, then press Enter. The list now shows only that rule."
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "In the **Total active series** row, click **More**, select **Delete**, and click **Yes, delete**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/list"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "li[role='treeitem']:contains('Total active series') button[aria-label='More']",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/list",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "button[role='menuitem']:contains('Delete')",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[role='dialog'] button:contains('Yes, delete')",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "If the list still shows a rule named **Total active series**, you created the rule more than once. Delete each one the same way."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The rule no longer appears on the **Alert rules** page."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Delete the folder you created for the rule."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-rule-delete-the-folder",
      "title": "Delete the folder",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/dashboards",
          "content": "Go to **Dashboards**. The folder you created is still there after the rule is deleted, and folders are managed on the **Dashboards** page.",
          "verify": "on-page:/dashboards"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Browse dashboards search input']",
          "targetvalue": "Recording rule practice (learning path)",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/dashboards",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "In the search box, enter `Recording rule practice (learning path)`. The list now shows only that folder."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "main a[href^='/dashboards/f/']:contains('Recording rule practice (learning path)')",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/dashboards",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Click **Recording rule practice (learning path)** to open the folder."
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Click **Folder actions**, select **Delete this folder**, type `Delete` to confirm, and click **Delete**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/dashboards/f/"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "main button:contains('Folder actions')",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/dashboards/f/",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "button[role='menuitem']:contains('Delete this folder')",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Confirm Modal Input']",
              "targetvalue": "Delete",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Confirm Modal Danger Button']",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "If the search still shows a folder named **Recording rule practice (learning path)**, you created the folder more than once. Delete each one the same way."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Your stack no longer has the rule or its folder."
    }
  ]
}
